{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"“Hesse 矩阵”"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"Hesse矩阵"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>对于 Riemann 流形 $M$ 上的函数 $u$, Hesse 矩阵\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hess}u := \\nabla^2 u = \\nabla(du)\r\n$$\n是 $T^*M\\otimes T^*M$ 的截面. 由 $\\nabla$ 的定义,\n$$\r\n\\nabla^2 u (X,Y)=\\nabla_X(\\nabla u)(Y)=\\nabla_X\\nabla_Y u - \\nabla_{\\nabla_{X}Y}u.\r\n$$\n由 "},{"Local":{"url":"Levi-Civita联络","text":"Levi-Civita 联络"}},{"Plain":"的无挠性, 知 Hesse 矩阵对称:\n$$\r\n\\nabla^2 u(X,Y)=\\nabla^2 u (Y,X).\r\n$$\n使用局部坐标,\n$$\r\n\\nabla^2 u = (\\partial _i\\partial _j u-\\Gamma_{ij}^k\\partial _k u) dx^i\\otimes dx^j.\r\n$$\nHesse 矩阵的迹是 "},{"Local":{"url":"Laplace算子","text":"Laplace 算子"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}